>> title: Larb Gai
>> category: Salads
>> tags: chicken, thai, salad, mint, lime
>> counters: Thai Kitchen, The Bowl Shop
>> aka: laab gai, larp gai, larb kai, lahb, laab, larb, minced chicken salad
>> pairs-with: som-tum
>> servings: 4
>> time: 30 min

>> step: toast 8 min, grind coarse
Toast @glutinous rice{2%Tbs}(raw, uncooked) in a dry #skillet{} over medium heat for ~toast{8%min}, shaking it until it is the colour of weak tea, then grind it to a coarse sand in a #mortar{}.

>> step: poach 5 min, breaking it fine
Poach @ground chicken{1%lb}(450 g) in @chicken stock{1/4%cup}(60 mL) in a #wok{} over medium heat for ~poach{5%min}, breaking it fine with a spoon.

>> step: dress off the heat
Dress @&(~1)chicken{} off the heat with @fish sauce{3%Tbs}, @lime juice{1/4%cup}(60 mL), @toasted chile powder{2%tsp} and @palm sugar{1%tsp}, and taste it while it is warm: sour first, then salty, then a little sweet.

>> step: toss
Toss @&(~1)larb{} with @&(~3)toasted rice powder{}, @shallots{3}(thinly sliced), @mint{1%cup}(leaves), @cilantro{1/2%cup}(chopped) and @scallions{3}(thinly sliced).
